sequenceDiagram
    participant Trainer as Kubeflow Trainer controller
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    participant Launcher as training_hub launcher<br/>sft() / osft() in pod
    participant Workers as torchrun workers<br/>InstructLab / Mini-Trainer
    participant Peers as Peer pods<br/>master_port/TCP + NCCL
    participant PVC as PVC output_dir
    participant S3 as S3-compatible storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant LLM as OpenAI-compatible endpoint<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow tracking<br/>URI-defined

    Note over Trainer,S3: Flow 1 - Distributed SFT/OSFT inside a TrainJob
    Trainer->>Launcher: Pod spec with PET_* env and command<br/>Kubernetes RBAC
    Launcher->>S3: Write/read/delete probe at train() entry<br/>AWS creds from env
    Launcher->>Workers: Process spawn + TRAINING_HUB_CALLBACKS_PATH<br/>payload file mode 0600
    Workers->>Workers: exec() rebuilds callback classes
    Workers->>Peers: c10d rendezvous + NCCL collectives<br/>No TLS, no auth
    Workers->>PVC: Write checkpoints to ckpt_output_dir
    Launcher->>S3: Node-0 uploads checkpoint-N/ + .upload_complete<br/>HTTPS TLS (SDK default)

    Note over Kubelet,S3: Flow 2 - JIT preemption checkpoint and resume
    Kubelet->>Workers: SIGTERM (eviction / preemption)
    Workers->>Peers: all_reduce MAX on stop flag<br/>NCCL/Gloo, no encryption
    Workers->>PVC: Save checkpoint at shared step boundary
    Launcher->>S3: Upload during grace period (default 120s)<br/>4 workers, 3 attempts
    Note over Launcher,S3: Restarted pod
    S3-->>Launcher: Restore completed checkpoint<br/>via .restore_tmp to output_dir

    Note over Launcher,MLflow: Flow 3 - GEPA prompt optimization
    Launcher->>Launcher: gepa() sets OPENAI_API_BASE / OPENAI_API_KEY<br/>("dummy" if unset), restored afterwards
    Launcher->>LLM: Task + reflection LLM calls via litellm<br/>Bearer OPENAI_API_KEY
    LLM-->>Launcher: Completions
    Launcher->>MLflow: Optional MLflowGEPABackend tracking<br/>MLflow SDK auth
    Launcher->>PVC: Write optimized prompts to output_dir

    Note over Launcher,MLflow: Flow 4 - GRPO with verl
    Launcher->>Workers: subprocess.Popen verl, stdout pipe parsed for metrics
    Workers->>Peers: vLLM rollouts + trainer via Ray / NCCL<br/>No encryption
    Workers->>MLflow: Optional metrics to MLflow or W&B<br/>HTTPS 443 / API key
